sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor U as User
    participant E as ESP32
    participant C as Camera
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant P as Image Preprocessing
    participant A as LangGraph / Classifier
    participant V as Vision Provider
    participant S as Servo
    participant H as HC-SR04
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    U->>E: Đưa 1 vật vào

    E->>C: Capture JPEG
    C-->>E: JPEG bytes

    Note over E,API: HTTPS REST + multipart/form-data<br/>X-Device-Key

    E->>API: POST /devices/BIN-001/classify<br/>JPEG + transaction_id

    API->>API: Verify X-Device-Key
    API->>P: preprocess_image(JPEG)
    P-->>API: sanitized 512px image + pHash

    API->>A: agent.invoke(state)

    A->>A: T0 pHash cache
    A->>A: T0.5 CLIP local

    opt Chưa đủ confidence
        A->>V: HTTPS Vision API
        V-->>A: label + items + confidence
    end

    A->>A: _finalize()

    alt Confidence đủ + class hợp lệ
        A-->>API: plastic, 0.94
        API-->>E: 200 JSON<br/>action=SORT<br/>target_bin=PLASTIC

        E->>S: Move to PLASTIC
        S-->>E: Done

        E->>H: Measure plastic compartment
        H-->>E: distance

        E->>E: Calculate fill_percent

        Note over E,API: HTTPS REST + application/json<br/>X-Device-Key

        E->>API: POST /bins/BIN-001/readings<br/>fill_percent=43
        API->>DB: Save reading + transaction
        DB-->>API: OK

    else Low confidence / unsafe
        A-->>API: refused / uncertain
        API-->>E: 200 JSON<br/>action=REJECT
        E->>E: Không điều khiển sorting servo
    end
